===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Sun & Moon|Rowlet|9}} from the {{TCG|Sun & Moon}} expansion; both cards have the Leafage attack.
*{{m|Leafage}} is a [[move]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that {{p|Rowlet}} can learn.
